s being filled with rage in their 2e writeup, so there\u2019s something to be explored there as well. <br /> <br /> Although, as Charlaquin said, V fits Deviant way, way more than Promethean, down to both material and theme. It\u2019s even right in the title- V for \u201cVendetta.\u201d","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>MtAw Homebrew:<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1051456-even-more-legacies-updated-to-2e#post1051456\" target=\"_blank\">Even more Legacies, updated to 2E</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1443819-new-2e-legacies-expanded\" target=\"_blank\">New 2E Legacies, expanded</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12619-21c-hermit","name":"21C Hermit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12619_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3489"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T21:57:39-08:00","id":1156236,"title":"","content":"Okay, let's recast topic then - <b>What could you get for Deviant from the movie? </b>It's PtC in forum, but I think mods can move topic later, when DtR subforum will be open.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-05T22:31:59-08:00","id":1156241,"title":"","content":"It\u2019s a bit difficult to mine inspirational media for ideas when the game itself isn\u2019t out yet. But we can at least draw parallels between the movie/graphic novels and what we know of the game so far.<br /> <br /> Clearly V\u2019s progenitors are the scientists at the Larkhill resettlement camp. A significant part of his arc is his quest for revenge against them, which might make that his Conviction. Then again, he\u2019s equally motivated to incite revolution against the Norsefire. We don\u2019t really know if it\u2019s possible for Convictions to shift, but if it is, I would say his Conviction is initially focused around the Larkhill scientists, but gradually shifts to a broader context of the fascist systems that created Larkhill in the first place.<br /> <br /> On the flip side, it seems like his Loyalty could be to Evey, or to his ideals of civil anarchy. Conversely, to his Conviction, it seems that his Loyalty starts out broad and becomes more personal throughout his arc.<br /> <br /> Couldn\u2019t make a guess as to his Clade or Origin without knowing more about what the options are. Same for his Variations and Scars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-06T08:59:18-08:00","id":1156363,"title":"","content":"As long as the thread is still in the Promethean forum, we might as well explore the idea of V as Frankenstein a little further. We know that Larkhill was testing various chemicals and pathogens on the inmates there; maybe &quot;the man in Room 5&quot; became a different sort of experiment, grafting organs and other body parts that were relatively undamaged after the treatments from deceased test subjects. Somehow he seemingly returned from death, then fell into Stannum almost immediately after finding the letter and realizing what was going on. Evie is his attempt at a different kind of Multiplicatio before he finally has to go to the River... hoping that he'll find the New Dawn on his return, but still satisfied with his efforts to change the world if not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/747-knowbody","name":"Knowbody","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-13T05:01:09-08:00","id":1158136,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/999219-v-for-vendetta?p=999230#post999230\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm pretty sure V is a Deviant.</div> </div> </div> </div>Keeping his origin exactly the same, he would be - but I can definitely see the thematic resonance in playing up \u201cV is a new person created in those experiments - he\u2019s not any specific person/people his body was made from\u201d.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0